    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2faeab3edca5a895eda7dac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石的慰劳，令我感慨万分。\n我起初配不上她，如今也走到了这里……\n这一路上，她都好好地看着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2bd378ffa11534fa81345ee99533b19bd9dcfe4dfadfc69c7e2061e62d79d6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
